What is printed by the following C code?

int f(int n) { if (n <= 1) return 1; return n * f(n - 2); }
int main() { printf("%d", f(7)); return 0; }

What is printed by the following C code?

int count() { static int c = 0; c += 2; return c; }
int main() { count(); count(); printf("%d", count()); return 0; }

What is the output of the following C++ code?

class Base { public: virtual void show() { cout << "B"; } };
class Der : public Base { public: void show() { cout << "D"; } };
int main() { Base *p = new Der; p->show(); return 0; }

What is printed by the following Java code?

